# 8. 🌎 INTERNATIONAL 7-DAY ACCESS

International users purchase:

> **$1 / 7 Days**

The active 7-day access can be used for the platform's available services, including:

* PDF to Word
* Word to PDF
* PDF Compression
* File Lock / Unlock
* PDF to Excel
* PDF Editing / Signing
* Document Search
* Document Preview
* Document Download

---

# 9. DAILY USAGE PROTECTION

The international plan has an internal usage protection:

**Maximum 10 services per 24-hour period.**

This limit is NOT displayed before purchase.

The user sees:

> **$1 / 7 Days**

If the user attempts an 11th service after reaching the daily limit:

```text
10 services used
      ↓
11th service attempted
      ↓
Daily limit reached
      ↓
Service becomes available again
when the next 24-hour period applies
```

The 7-day access period continues normally.

The limit is enforced by the backend/database.

---

# 10. PAYMENT VERIFICATION

Payment confirmation must never rely only on frontend logic.

```text
User Payment
     ↓
Payment Provider
     ↓
Provider Confirmation / Webhook
     ↓
Backend Verification
     ↓
Payment Marked Successful
     ↓
Access Granted
     ↓
Service / Save to Device
```

The backend must protect against:

* Fake payment confirmation
* Duplicate payment
* Reused transactions
* Unauthorized access
* Payment bypass
* Frontend manipulation

---

# 11. MERCHANT / REVENUE ACCOUNT

Customer payments should be processed through appropriate merchant/business accounts supported by each payment provider.

General model:

```text
Customer
   ↓
Payment Provider
   ↓
Merchant / Business Balance
   ↓
Payout
   ↓
Supported Bank / Withdrawal Account
```

Provider-specific payout accounts, KYC requirements, settlement methods, withdrawal options, and eligibility must be verified before production implementation.

