# 15. STABILITY-FIRST REQUIREMENT

The project priority is not to launch as quickly as possible.

The core principle is:

> **Build the system correctly and stably so that users do not experience payment, conversion, download, or service failures after launch.**

Before production launch, test:

* Successful payment
* Failed payment
* Cancelled payment
* Delayed confirmation
* Duplicate payment
* Webhook failure
* Network failure
* Expired 7-day access
* Daily usage limit
* Refund handling
* Unauthorized access
* Payment verification failure

No payment provider or pricing architecture is considered fully final until its real technical requirements, availability, fees, KYC, payout options, and legal/tax requirements have been verified.

